  + zero Cargo dependency lockfile unsafe platform or effect delta

& [T01_HistoricalAuthorityReplay] old signed 0.1 generation is presented as current
  + denied by invalidation UUID and replacement generation/hash binding
& [T02_CarrierDecodeLaundering] serialized digest or binding is decoded as invocation input
  + denied because invocation accepts owned typed carriers and all carrier-bearing types lack DeserializeOwned
& [T03_PredecessorWeakening] current carrier gains Deserialize or public construction
  + denied by exact predecessor hashes and negative trait assertion
& [T04_DigestLocatorSubstitution] a digest string key or resolver replaces complete ancestry
  + denied by owned-argument signature and static field audit
& [T05_CarrierRoleSwap] valid carriers are reversed across metadata roles
  + denied by fixed First/Second argument association and independent exposed-coordinate joins
& [T06_MetadataOnlyInflation] declared root policy or predecessor fields are called carrier-proven
  + denied by coordinate classification and nonclaim assertions
& [T07_PartialScopeJoin] only digest or root identity is compared
  + denied by complete metadata equality plus all nine carrier-exposed joins
& [T08_RederivationSkip] retained digest bytes are trusted
  + denied by two independent current derivations before reconciliation
& [T09_ReconciliationShortcut] direct string equality substitutes for current reconciliation
  + denied by current plan/profile/function and retained reconciliation output
& [T10_EqualInflation] Equal is treated as acquisition order stability snapshot or truth
  + denied by ClaimOnly NonAtomicRepeatedInventoryEqual and inherited nonclaims
& [T11_MetadataPermissiveness] aliases defaults unknown fields or omitted coordinates enter
  + denied by strict serde grammar and metadata round-trip/negative cases
& [T12_OutputReplay] serialized result re-enters production construction
  + denied by negative DeserializeOwned and constructor/conversion absence
& [T13_PartialFault] a valid binding or reconciliation leaks with a refusal
  + denied by single Result return and construction after all gates
& [T14_ResourcePressure] open collections or diagnostics expand work
  + denied by exact two-carrier cardinality inherited nested bounds and bounded fields/messages
& [T15_TestFixtureLaundering] synthetic construction resembles admitted production lineage
  + denied by claim vocabulary cfg(test) containment and complete absence of admission API
& [T16_AuthorityCreep] code adds producer issuer consumer receipt or effect behavior
  + denied by one-module static diff and zero-effect gate
& [T17_TraitProofApproximation] runtime JSON tests replace compile-time trait closure
  + denied by mandatory positive and negative Rust assertions before replacement signature
& [T18_GenerationMixing] old canonical or proof hashes are combined with new implementation
  + denied by full 0.2 artifact generation and exact phase-lock predecessor table

& [DualHemisphereReview] converges
  + constructive pass retains the smallest useful metadata-to-carrier binding waist
  + adversarial pass finds no path from decoding validation rederivation reconciliation or serialization to carrier reconstruction or physical authority
  + role identities remain source author SJS processor claim author carrier supplier pure validator future producer future issuer and future consumer

